{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011CfFZZ16Fs5mh5bY3po8xf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01885ftA7uwjVKq4QyHQ5Vvi","name":"SubagentHandback","input":{"message":"Implementation complete. All three edits were made to `/workspace/libFRNN/src/frnn.cu`:\n\n1. `findNeighborsWarpCoop<StaticDimension>` kernel inserted after the existing `findNeighbors` kernel (~line 553).\n2. `blocksForWarp` helper + `launchGridNeighborsWarpCoop` launch wrapper inserted after the `#undef FRNN_LAUNCH_GRID` block (~line 636).\n3. `buildEdgesAsync` dispatch updated to call `launchGridNeighborsWarpCoop` (with updated error message \"launch findNeighborsWarpCoop\").\n\n**Build:** Succeeded. One expected warning: `launchGridNeighbors` declared but never referenced (it's kept intact as required).\n\n**Correctness tests:** All passed (1/1, 100%).\n\n**Benchmark result (device_warm_gpu p50): 537.598 ms**\n- stage_neighbor_search p50: 533.963 ms\n- GPU: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 SUPER, compute capability 7.5 (Turing)\n\n**Performance outcome: worse than the 307 ms baseline, not better.** The warp-cooperative approach fully serializes heap insertions through lane 0 while 31 lanes idle during the `while (remaining)` loop. The `__ballot_sync`/`__shfl_sync` overhead per 32-candidate batch, combined with the completely serialized heap in lane 0, outweighs the working-set reduction benefit on this Turing-class GPU. The <200 ms target was not achieved.\n\nThe implementation is architecturally correct (tests pass, API unchanged, brute-force kernel untouched), but the performance hypothesis did not hold on the RTX 2070 Super."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1992,"cache_read_input_tokens":23132,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1992,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0143vpnWKQ4LXwzLCnSsDWTM","session_id":"6f82439e-67c9-4df8-8006-0f75deb44a8f","uuid":"48b663b3-7e44-4c1f-ab79-8078cf0e3eb2","timestamp":"2026-09-20T23:31:07.351Z","request_id":"req_011CfFZYzdDZNAiQdeiQNN56","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement warp-cooperative FRNN neighbor search kernel"}
